⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
253 calories 25g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Pumpkin Cheesecake Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 145 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40-45g Monk Fruit Sweetener (or any sugar substitute)
- 60g canned pumpkin
- 30g (2 tbsp) Pumpkin cream cheese (can sub with regular cream cheese + 5g brown sugar sweetener + a dash of cinnamon and pumpkin pie spice)
- 2.5g (½ tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- 2g (½ tsp) pumpkin pie spice
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- ½ sheet of a graham cracker
253 cal 26g C, 5g F, 25g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 24 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if necessary
5. Respin again if powdery
6. Top with the crumbled up graham crackers

